  "description": "LondonDataServices.OlidsToFhirMapper.STU3 provides mapper conversions from OLIDS data to FHIR STU3 resources. \n\t\t  It is designed to facilitate the integration of OLIDS data into FHIR-compliant systems, \n\t\t  enabling seamless data exchange and interoperability within healthcare applications.",
