  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "The patient's registered practice is now sent as an Organization resource, as DDS sends it.\n\t\t  - Each row of the mart's Organisation variant (new OlidsPatient.Organisations list) goes out as an Organization resource.\n\t\t  - Patient.managingOrganization references the registered practice's Organization (Organization/{id}) when it is in the record, and names it by the practice's own ODS code and name instead of the record owner's. A code or name the practice row lacks is left out. If the practice row repeats, the first one is used.\n\t\t  - Organisation.TypeDesc now binds the mart's type_description key.\n\t\t  - The Organisation mapper is now required, like every other mapper; the client and AddOlidsToFhirMapperServices already register it, so no consumer change is needed.\n\t\t  - Until the mart sends Organisation rows, the output is unchanged.",
